---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Ancient Chinese Architecture Project" description="Learn about Ancient Chinese Architecture, a digital museum exploring 3,000 years of Chinese architectural heritage through interactive tools and visual guides.">
  <Nav />
  <section class="pt-24 pb-16 px-6 bg-stone-light">
    <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto">
      <p class="text-vermillion text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 font-display">About</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-6">About This Project</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-lg text-ink-muted space-y-4">
        <p>Ancient Chinese Architecture is a digital museum dedicated to exploring 3,000 years of Chinese architectural heritage. From the rammed-earth foundations of the Shang dynasty to the ornate palace complexes of the Qing, our mission is to make this extraordinary building tradition accessible, visual, and engaging.</p>
        <p>We believe that architecture tells the story of a civilization — its values, its technology, its relationship with nature and the cosmos. Every dougong bracket, every sweeping roof curve, every courtyard layout embodies centuries of accumulated wisdom and artistry.</p>
        <p>This site combines scholarly research with interactive tools and high-quality visuals to create an experience you cannot get from a textbook or a Wikipedia article. We are building the resource we wish had existed when we first became fascinated by Chinese architecture.</p>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl text-ink mt-8 mb-4">Contact</h2>
        <p>For inquiries, corrections, or contributions, reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@ancient-chinese-architecture.com" class="text-vermillion hover:text-vermillion-dark transition-colors">hello@ancient-chinese-architecture.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
